子们沉浸在塞涅的歌声中，竟无人回神。","source_cn":"一曲唱罢，孩子们沉浸在塞涅的歌声中，竟无人回神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F8723977A70B9DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1821332012:1":{"text":"塞……塞涅姐姐唱歌真好听……","source_cn":"塞……塞涅姐姐唱歌真好听……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0384629B5A03CF8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1821332013:1":{"text":"我，我想家了……","source_cn":"我，我想家了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9367A383679E91E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1821332014:1":{"text":"别离是为了更好的相聚……就像，我在这里遇到了塞涅姐姐……","source_cn":"别离是为了更好的相聚……就像，我在这里遇到了塞涅姐姐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46E97228FF8C5C4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1821332015:1":{"text":"布鲁诺，你虽与生者告别，却与身为亡者的我们相遇。你身边的弗雷底、莉栗，也是在你这个年纪死去，他们都曾像你一样无助而胆怯。","source_cn":"布鲁诺，你虽与生者告别，却与身为亡者的我们相遇。你身边...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x883527128E79C5C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1821332016:1":{"text":"但在大家的帮助下，他们用了几个世纪的时间，成长为你现在所见到的样子。","source_cn":"但在大家的帮助下，他们用了几个世纪的时间，成长为你现在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8